{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-15_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-15","title":"回答我","storyCode":"11-17","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"60f85a3ac33ebff852da91b2d3f21a4c9278003e4ef400e7f6cf8a8746d46274","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"羅德島與自救軍聯軍撤退途中，阿米婭被薩卡茲眾魂的聲音影響。此時，特雷西斯也出現在戰場上。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*，這些新來的敵人怎麼這麼硬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，一起衝上去！衝......衝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來！別靠近！離那些已經死去的人遠......遠......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......怎、怎麼回事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在倒下的戰士周圍，一股前所未見的力量正在戰場上彌漫。\n有什麼東西源源不斷地從他們的皮膚上、眼睛裡、耳鼻中析出來。不是血液，不是什麼實質上的器官組織。\n或許是恐懼，一種對死後的未知的恐懼。這種無法對抗的恐懼正在迅速地帶走他們的生命力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"退後！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又能呼吸了！謝謝你，羅德島的......醫生？可露希爾小姐說你是醫生，沒......錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有人，退到我身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是......巫術？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我聞到了和溫迪戈的祭壇差不多的味道。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲的古老巫術，都有著相似的發源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"溫迪戈，食腐者，血魔，石翼魔，巫妖......甚至女妖。死亡是大多數生物的終點，卻是許多薩卡茲汲取力量的源頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的劍......擋住了污染的蔓延？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......死亡與生命從來都是硬幣的兩面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我能阻擋的時間很有限。我們對抗不了食腐者的軍隊，即便抵達此處的只是他麾下的先鋒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"那位古老的薩卡茲鞭笞著腐敗與死亡蠕行於戰場，我也只是在過去聽聞過些許傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們得趕快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"凱爾希已給出了明確的撤退訊號。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（急切的尖嘯）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希爾，立刻回收無人機。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......沒辦法了對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數據回傳......百分之七十......好，就這麼多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"費斯特，去找克洛維希婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，跟上我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島的各位，跟上Mon3tr！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"羅德島的各位，按計劃掩護自救軍撤退！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有阿米婭他們。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"通知阿米婭、Logos和阿斯卡綸。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有回音。\n你的呼叫沒有任何結果。\n不對勁。即便是在最激烈的戰鬥中，阿米婭都不會輕易忽視你的聲音。\nPRTS並不能顯示幹員們的處境，可你已經意識到了她正面臨著多大的危險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，食腐者提前到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......該撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生的速度已經夠快，拖延巫妖的腳步已是極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者麾下軍士的凝聚力遠勝任何薩卡茲勢力，他們的行動會非常迅速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"撤退？\n不。\n他們無法逃脫。血魔的鮮血桎梏可以劈開，食腐者的死亡浸染可以抵擋，但只要他們逃不出這片大地，就逃不過陰雲的注視。\n因為屬於薩卡茲的恨意與悲痛本就無處不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無數聲音湧進她的腦海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她聽見在戰爭中失去父母的孩子一邊走在廢墟中一邊輕輕嗚咽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她聽見稚嫩的戰士第一次揮劍斬向敵人頭顱時，劍鋒傳來的悶響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她聽見女妖身披銀月，面朝髒亂畸形的都城，一遍遍地吟誦剛剛學來的咒文。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她聽見血魔的輕笑，他獨自一人站在峽谷中，將無數衝向薩卡茲聚落的敵人化作血海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她聽見死去的魂靈們正背朝天空，對著大地吼叫。\n憑什麼就該我們死去？\n就因為我們是薩卡茲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的線條正不受控制地從她的眼睛裡、口鼻中湧出來，不斷地延伸，不斷地纏繞。\n所有薩卡茲的心臟都像是被黑色的絲線抓住了一瞬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。別被影響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，博士，我聽到了......我聽到了什麼聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊不清的薩卡茲某部族語言*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下充斥黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑暗滋生邪惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邪惡帶來痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊不清的薩卡茲某部族語言*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾在說什麼？我聽不太懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好暈......我的腦袋......是不是壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，是薩卡茲的巫術在攻擊我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我沒有感覺......呃，快看，敵人也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑暗......痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分享......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我聽過這段話。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我聽過類似的語言。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一種特殊的精神暗示。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一種並不常規的法術。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，請立刻跟隨自救軍與其他幹員撤離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是阿米婭......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"閃靈......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"連你也受到了影響？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"失控的力量正在侵蝕所有薩卡茲的心靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"就連赦罪師都無法抵禦......即便我暫時可以忍受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"失控的力量？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"難道是......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"只有薩卡茲的君主，能夠將將士們渴望的願景作為撫慰，也能調動叛徒們內心最深處的恐懼當作懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"只有“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什麼，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想......正在無差別攻擊所有薩卡茲的，究竟是哪一位魔王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭很危險。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是我最擔心的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"無論動手的人是不是特蕾西婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王的力量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你這樣未經錘煉的身軀，怎麼可能承受得住薩卡茲萬年的回憶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪......難怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你承受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上的那些戒指......是特蕾西婭留給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們以為這樣就能將饋贈與詛咒一同鎖住，卻忘了贈予之物亦可被收回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，你應該也有所察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是殿下在影響阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰況已不允許任何拖延。食腐者與特雷西斯隨時可能現身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，我們必須將阿米婭強行帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戒指上並沒有裂紋，也沒有變色。\n它們只是在顫抖。因為她在顫抖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你配不上特蕾西婭傳予你的冠冕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這並非因為你不是薩卡茲，而是因為你從未試圖理解過薩卡茲的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你與特蕾西婭一樣，被那個自稱凱爾希的怪物蒙蔽了雙目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為薩卡茲和菲林一樣，是由近似的血脈聯繫在一起的某支種族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當我們的憤怒只是在對抗某種不公正的待遇，你把我們對他們的抗爭當作國與國之間的爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而真的是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我邀請你直視我的憤恨，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我邀請你......好好聽一聽頭頂陰雲中的慟哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會告訴你，薩卡茲與那些可恥的侵略者......你們口中的神民與先民從來不是同類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾也從來不是一座都城，一個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在薩卡茲還被稱作提卡茲，還擁有家園的那個年代——卡茲戴爾指的是我們目所能及的整個世界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾本應與泰拉同義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"無止境的悲哀包裹著她，纏住她的手腳，堵住她的口鼻。\n不管她看向哪裡，陰雲都填滿了她的視野。\n要如何才能逃脫？憑什麼能夠逃脫？\n她只能聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個薩卡茲爬上城牆。\n他的身後是一座鐵灰色的城市，他的頭頂飄揚著黑色的旗幟。\n傷痕累累的戰士們在身前列陣。與他差不多年紀卻未經訓練的薩卡茲則手握生銹的刀劍守著城牆。\n另有無數同胞正站在他的身後，他們或老或少，手裡握著的可能只是打獵用的弓弩。\n而敵人已經踏過荒原，來到他們的城市跟前。\n他聽到高塔術師的法杖整齊地劃開空氣。\n他聽到高盧炮兵操控著源石炮轉向。\n他聽到蒸汽甲胄行軍時沉重的腳步聲，以及衝刺時的噴氣聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i07"},{"type":"narration","text":"他聽到風把領頭將領的衣袍吹起，與甲胄相撞，發出冰冷的聲音。\n那個菲林是誰？蒸汽騎士就站在她的身後。她是維多利亞的將領？可是高塔術師與高盧炮兵也都聽從她的指揮。\n他聽到她開口宣判著薩卡茲的罪行。\n“我知曉薩卡茲正在籌劃的一切。仇恨是無法治癒的絕症，你們的復仇將會為大地帶來無法治癒的傷痕。”\n“為了周圍諸國的安定，為了之後兩百年的和平，野心必須被提前消滅。”\n大火從四面八方湧向卡茲戴爾。又一座卡茲戴爾即將變成廢墟。無數薩卡茲在這場大火裡前赴後繼地死去，而走出大火的只會更加不幸。\n為什麼要殺死我？\n只因為我們有著不同的起源？只因為這片大地已經承載不了我們的怨恨，就要提前將我們全部抹去？\n六位英雄從廢墟之中站起。他們扛起燃燒著的卡茲戴爾的旗幟，向面前的大軍發起衝鋒。\n沒有一個薩卡茲會心甘情願地死去。剛剛倒下的成千上萬的薩卡茲們的悲號化作戰鼓，跟隨著英雄們的腳步奔向敵軍。\n回答我，仇敵！\n你是什麼人，憑什麼能夠決定卡茲戴爾應當覆滅？\n你是什麼人，憑什麼能夠審判薩卡茲的所做作為？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"為什麼不說話？\n為什麼不回答我的問題？\n凱爾希......凱爾希！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾的城牆正在坍塌。伴隨著灰燼與殘垣，死去的薩卡茲也在下墜。\n她在下墜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腦袋好像沒那麼暈了......呃，我能看見東西了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，塔上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希爾，無人機！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"刺客擋住了血魔的追擊。\n咒術大師延緩了墜落的速度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滑索綁在你的身上，無人機拉著你迅速穿過這片戰場。\n在阿米婭的身體快要觸到地面之前，你抓住了她的手，將她抱在懷中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希......醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，為什麼......阿米婭一直在念凱爾希的名字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你在阿米婭的眼角看到了悲哀的淚水，卻也在她緊皺的眉間讀出了憤怒。\n她到底看到了什麼，又聽到了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，博士，有什麼正在迅速靠近——等，這麼快？！在哪？！快找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他......一開始就在......那、那裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"人影。\n一個薩卡茲無聲地投來視線。\n與血魔那黏稠的殺意截然不同，亦沒有赦罪師傲慢的蔑視或食腐者恐怖的氣息，與那位溫迪戈相比，他的身形甚至稍顯瘦小。\n只是一個薩卡茲。沒有軍隊，沒有侍從，從王座上突兀地站起，放下他從未真正在意過的權力，踱步至此。\n投來了兩百餘年歲月中最冷峻的目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"narration","text":"在你看清他的樣子之前，他的劍已來到你的跟前。\n阿米婭會死。你不鬆開阿米婭的話，你也一定會死。\n從踏入這片戰場的那一刻起，他就只有一個目標，殺死落入你懷中的“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i08_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"（極度痛苦的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i08_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希！\n你脫口而出。\n她正瀕臨死亡。或許下一刻她就會死去。\n你以前從未如此清晰地感受過這種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著阿米婭......撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"（竭盡全力的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"竭盡全力的迎擊，也只是將那把貌不驚人的長劍頂開了些許。\n可露希爾拼命拉著你，你抱著阿米婭。\n你們在無人機的拉扯下飛速地後退，而滿身鮮血的凱爾希......依舊擋在你們身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（微弱的掙扎）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......你選擇了再一次與薩卡茲為敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"兩百年前，我看著你重生在特蕾西婭的身邊。一度毀滅卡茲戴爾的罪魁禍首，一個馴化古老的不滅之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你為她做了許多事，講述那些我們永遠看不見的遙遠幻境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"多遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......你只是在加快毀滅的進程。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，你不能再—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"—唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。但是薩卡茲要快毀滅一步，而不是被你們冷酷的規劃奪走生存的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經沒有力氣說話了。你攔截了巫妖的信使，了不起，軍事委員會都還沒發現他們的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"但看得出，你們交談得並不愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我當時警告過你的那樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"我會再殺死你一次，凱爾希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]}]}
